parameter, recursively generates the previous element (the tuple of iterators) in <code>cartesian_product_view</code>.\n</p><p>Let <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/cartesian_product_view/iterator#Data_members\"><code><i>current_</i></code></a> denote the underlying tuple of iterators. Equivalent to:\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> it <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>current_<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>N <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>it <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/begin\"><span class=\"kw2900\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>parent_<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>bases_<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        it <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*cartesian-common-arg-end*/</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>parent_<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>bases_<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        prev<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>N <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"sy2\">--</span>it<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n<p>Used in the following non-static member functions:\n</p>\n<ul><li> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ranges<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">cartesian_product_view</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span></span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/cartesian_product_view/iterator/operator_arith\"><code>operator-</code></a>\n</li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"distance_from\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-member\">\n<h2 id=\"std::ranges::cartesian_product_view::iterator::distance_from\"><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ranges::cartesian_product_view::<i>iterator</i>::</span><i>distance_from</i></h2>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Tuple <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> difference_type<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*distance-from*/</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> Tuple<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> t <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark t-mark-expos\">(<span>exposition only*</span>)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the \"distance\" (i.e., number of \"hops\") between two <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/cartesian_product_view/iterator\">iterators</a>.\n</p><p>Let:\n</p>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/cartesian_product_view/iterator#Data_members\"><code><i>parent_</i></code></a> be the underlying poi