e<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>current_<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>t<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*scaled-size*/</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>N <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*scaled-sum*/</span></span></code> be the sum of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*scaled-distance*/</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>N<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> for every integer <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">0</span> ≤ N ≤ sizeof...<span class=\"br0\">(</span>Vs<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</li></ul>\n<p>Returns: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*scaled-sum*/</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>The behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*scaled-sum*/</span></span></code> cannot be represented by <code>difference_type</code>.\n</p><p>Used in the following functions:\n</p>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/cartesian_product_view/iterator/operator_arith2\"><code>operator-</code></a><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*iterator*/</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>, <span class=